# Ground-truth e2e fixture-build toolchain — source for requirements-groundtruth.lock.
#
# Used ONLY by the workflow_dispatch-gated e2e-groundtruth.yml job, by:
#   - tests/fixtures/oss/extract_ground_truth.py  (ELF symbol/section truth + capstone disasm check)
#   - scripts/naming_eval.py                       (ELF note/section parsing for the naming-eval loop)
# NOT a dependency of the vivarium package, the server, unit CI, or the worker — kept out of
# pyproject so it pins narrowly without dragging the base tree into the lock (std-supplychain).
#
# Regenerate the hash-pinned lock with:
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --output-file=requirements-groundtruth.lock requirements-groundtruth.in
# Both are permissive-licensed (pyelftools: public-domain/Unlicense; capstone: BSD-3-Clause).
